msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_101_NAME"
msgstr "Southeastern Plains"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_101_DESC"
msgstr "The gentlest heartland of the southeastern provinces, where fertile fields, canals, and sea winds open onto a broad plain."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_102_NAME"
msgstr "Western Drifting Sands"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_102_DESC"
msgstr "A western frontier where desert and sea winds meet among yellow dunes, salt flats, and broken stone."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_104_NAME"
msgstr "Northern Frostlands"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_104_DESC"
msgstr "A frozen plain stretching inland from the high, cold country, swept by unending icy winds."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_105_NAME"
msgstr "Far Tides of the Eastern Sea"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_105_DESC"
msgstr "A vast eastern sea where tides and shipping lanes cross through open water."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_106_NAME"
msgstr "Celestial River Estuary"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_106_DESC"
msgstr "Calm waters where river and sea meet, gentle enough for frequent boat traffic."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_107_NAME"
msgstr "Eastern Ridge Mountains"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_107_DESC"
msgstr "A long eastern mountain chain whose rolling spine divides the peaks from the sea."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_109_NAME"
msgstr "Central Grasslands"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_109_DESC"
msgstr "Broad grasslands woven with low hills, well suited to mortals and cultivation sects living side by side."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_110_NAME"
msgstr "Qingyun Forest Sea"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_110_DESC"
msgstr "An endless forest spread like a sea of clouds, rising in green waves whenever the wind passes."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_302_NAME"
msgstr "Southern Frontier City"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_302_DESC"
msgstr "A trading city on the edge of the southern rainforest, where herbs, beast bones, and distant travelers converge."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_403_NAME"
msgstr "Nanling Tranquil Sea Cliffs"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_403_DESC"
msgstr "A sect perched on coastal cliffs, its halls half hidden as sea mist climbs the ridge through the sound of tides."
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_409_NAME"
msgstr "Eastern Ridge Floating Isles"
msgid "MAP_REGION_CLASSIC_409_DESC"
msgstr "Floating islands above the eastern mountains, their terraced heights linked by cloud bridges and flying vessels."

msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_101_NAME"
msgstr "Lone Isle of the Central Sea"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_101_DESC"
msgstr "A midsized island adrift in a vast expanse of deep blue water."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_102_NAME"
msgstr "Northern Sand Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_102_DESC"
msgstr "A sandy island in the northern shallows, where reefs and ocher dunes meet a shoreline constantly reshaped by waves."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_105_NAME"
msgstr "Boundless Sea Realm"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_105_DESC"
msgstr "Here the sea itself is the land, and shipping routes and currents form its only roads."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_106_NAME"
msgstr "Tidal Passage"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_106_DESC"
msgstr "A navigable channel along the boundary of deep and shallow water, forming a natural route between islands."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_118_NAME"
msgstr "Outer Penglai Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_118_DESC"
msgstr "A solitary island far from the main archipelago, like a shard of jade scattered upon the sea."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_103_NAME"
msgstr "Western Rain Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_103_DESC"
msgstr "A humid western island where rainforest hugs the coast and ancient vines disappear into the sea mist."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_104_NAME"
msgstr "Northern Ice Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_104_DESC"
msgstr "An island ringed by northern cold currents, where sea winds drive snow across frozen shores and tundra."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_107_NAME"
msgstr "Eastern Crag Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_107_DESC"
msgstr "A rocky island rising from the eastern sea, with cliffs, reefs, and mountain ridges pressed close together."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_108_NAME"
msgstr "Snow Isle of the Cold Current"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_108_DESC"
msgstr "A snow-peaked island shaped by northern currents, its icy cliffs gleaming like a white ridge afloat on the sea."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_109_NAME"
msgstr "Central Sea Green Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_109_DESC"
msgstr "A mild, green island near the center of the archipelago and one of its few broad, welcoming landing places."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_110_NAME"
msgstr "Greenwood Inner Bay"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_110_DESC"
msgstr "A forested isle embraced by a bay, where shade and damp sea winds gather abundant wood essence."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_111_NAME"
msgstr "Crimson Reef Fire Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_111_DESC"
msgstr "A volcanic island in the western chain, where red reefs reach into the sea and hot mist escapes through cracks."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_112_NAME"
msgstr "Sea-Farm Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_112_DESC"
msgstr "A rare fertile flat in the central islands, where fresh water and sea winds nourish wide fields."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_113_NAME"
msgstr "Darktide Poison Bay"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_113_DESC"
msgstr "A poisoned marsh bay on the southwestern chain, thick with foul water, hidden currents, heat, and miasma."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_114_NAME"
msgstr "Southern Reef Mountains"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_114_DESC"
msgstr "A rugged belt of mountain reefs among the southern islands, where every short land route is cut by a strait."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_115_NAME"
msgstr "Bamboo-Shadow Isles"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_115_DESC"
msgstr "Small bamboo-covered isles scattered across the south-central sea, their rustling leaves often drowned by the tide."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_116_NAME"
msgstr "Northern Mist Wastes"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_116_DESC"
msgstr "A cold, barren northern island where sea fog and frozen ground hold the land in deep silence."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_117_NAME"
msgstr "Western Gravel Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_117_DESC"
msgstr "A gravel-covered isle beside the northwestern sands, its shores buried under weathered stone and salt crust."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_201_NAME"
msgstr "Eastern Sea Metal Sanctuary"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_201_DESC"
msgstr "A metal-aspected sanctuary deep within the eastern crags, where sea winds enter the caves and become clear sword song."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_202_NAME"
msgstr "Greenwood Bay Grotto-Heaven"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_202_DESC"
msgstr "A wood-aspected grotto-heaven in Greenwood Bay, gathering the damp breath of the forest and the vitality of the sea."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_203_NAME"
msgstr "Northern Sea Mystic Waters"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_203_DESC"
msgstr "A water-aspected secret realm deep in the northern sea, circled by currents and lit by jade glimmers in reef caves."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_205_NAME"
msgstr "Cold Current Mystic Palace"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_205_DESC"
msgstr "An earth-aspected palace within the snowy isle, where ice and bedrock resonate through walls smooth as jade."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_301_NAME"
msgstr "Central Sea City"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_301_DESC"
msgstr "The archipelago's central port, layered with shipyards, bridge markets, and floating docks."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_302_NAME"
msgstr "Sea-Farm City"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_302_DESC"
msgstr "A farming and trading city on Sea-Farm Isle, where freshwater wells stand beside salt stores and grain markets."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_303_NAME"
msgstr "Sandreef City"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_303_DESC"
msgstr "A reefside city on Northern Sand Isle, reached by tide and sail rather than desert caravan."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_304_NAME"
msgstr "Cold Bay City"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_304_DESC"
msgstr "A sheltered city on Northern Ice Isle, where a protected harbor and warm-stone streets welcome water cultivators."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_305_NAME"
msgstr "Mooncatcher Harbor"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_305_DESC"
msgstr "A moonlit harbor on the southeastern outer isle, favored by voyaging cultivators who anchor to watch the tides."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_401_NAME"
msgstr "Cloudpiercer Crag"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_401_DESC"
msgstr "A cliffside sect on the eastern crag isle, its cloud bridges hanging above the churning surf."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_405_NAME"
msgstr "Thousand Mechanisms Reef Valley"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_405_DESC"
msgstr "A mechanism-filled valley whose reef caves, stone bridges, and hidden doors turn the entire island into a maze."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_410_NAME"
msgstr "Southern Reef Echo Valley"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_410_DESC"
msgstr "A valley in the southern reef mountains where sea wind draws long, zither-like notes through holes in the rock."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_411_NAME"
msgstr "Eastern Sea Labyrinth Heaven"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_411_DESC"
msgstr "A folded mountain gate on the eastern crag isle, where sea fog confuses mountain paths with sea routes."
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_413_NAME"
msgstr "Eastern Grove Sage Isle"
msgid "MAP_REGION_ISLAND_SEAS_413_DESC"
msgstr "A coastal academy among eastern forests, where lectures and recitation mingle with the sound of tides."

msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_104_NAME"
msgstr "Northern Snow Ridge"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_104_DESC"
msgstr "A high snowline spread along the ridge, where cutting winds turn even level ground into hard slopes."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_107_NAME"
msgstr "Broken Ridge Peaks"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_107_DESC"
msgstr "The mountain range's hardest spine, where crowded peaks fracture into ridge after ridge."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_108_NAME"
msgstr "Cold Jade Heights"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_108_DESC"
msgstr "Snowbound high peaks with sweeping views and some of the frontier's most difficult crossings."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_110_NAME"
msgstr "Forest Valley Pass"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_110_DESC"
msgstr "Forest and gorge running side by side to form a winding, hidden passage through the mountains."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_111_NAME"
msgstr "Volcanic Forecourt"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_111_DESC"
msgstr "A borderland around the volcano where heated rock and cold winds meet head-on."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_114_NAME"
msgstr "Heart of Ten Thousand Mountains"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_114_DESC"
msgstr "The crowded heart of the range, dense with narrow roads, sheer ground, and overlapping peaks."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_101_NAME"
msgstr "Mountain Pass Flats"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_101_DESC"
msgstr "A rare flat between the mountains where the river valley opens and frontier settlements gather."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_102_NAME"
msgstr "Western Loess Foothills"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_102_DESC"
msgstr "Dry loess and scree on the western foothills, scoured by sand blown through the pass but far from an open desert."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_103_NAME"
msgstr "Southern Ridge Rainforest"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_103_DESC"
msgstr "A hot, dense forest below the southern mountains, wrapped in rain and mist that cling to the slopes."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_105_NAME"
msgstr "Narrow Eastern Sea"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_105_DESC"
msgstr "A narrow sea pressed against eastern cliffs, its coast broken into small harbors by the mountains."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_106_NAME"
msgstr "Rushing Gorge River"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_106_DESC"
msgstr "A swift river cutting through the mountains, its roar echoing off canyon walls beside the valley roads."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_112_NAME"
msgstr "Fertile Valley Fields"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_112_DESC"
msgstr "River-fed fields tucked between the mountains, small in area but precious as the frontier's granary."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_113_NAME"
msgstr "Southern Foothill Poison Marsh"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_113_DESC"
msgstr "A wetland deep in the southern foothills, where cold mountain runoff and rotting soil form treacherous bogs."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_115_NAME"
msgstr "Violet Bamboo Hollow"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_115_DESC"
msgstr "A secluded hollow where violet bamboo clings to rock walls and the wind carries an austere, crystalline sound."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_116_NAME"
msgstr "Northeastern Tundra"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_116_DESC"
msgstr "Frozen highlands northeast of the range, where winds crossing the snowline linger for months."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_117_NAME"
msgstr "Starshard Slope"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_117_DESC"
msgstr "A scree slope beyond the western ridge, made nearly impassable by weathered stone and tales of fallen star-metal."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_118_NAME"
msgstr "Relic Isle of the Eastern Sea"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_118_DESC"
msgstr "A solitary isle beyond the narrow eastern sea, like a fragment broken from the meeting place of mountain and ocean."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_201_NAME"
msgstr "Western Ridge Metal Sanctuary"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_201_DESC"
msgstr "A metal-aspected sanctuary deep in the western broken peaks, where sword song rebounds between stone walls."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_203_NAME"
msgstr "Gorge River Mystic Waters"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_203_DESC"
msgstr "A water-aspected secret realm at a bend in the gorge river, where rapids split the cliffs and cold essence gathers in deep pools."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_302_NAME"
msgstr "Western Ridge Waystation"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_302_DESC"
msgstr "A frontier waystation at the western pass, supplying miners, hunters, and cultivators bound for distant lands."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_304_NAME"
msgstr "Gorge River City"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_304_DESC"
msgstr "A river city below the gorge, where mountain goods and spiritual materials flow downstream to market."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_409_NAME"
msgstr "Southern Foothill Floating Isles"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_409_DESC"
msgstr "Floating islands above the poisonous southern marsh, linked by cloud bridges and flying vessels that avoid the miasma below."
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_411_NAME"
msgstr "Southern Mountain Labyrinth Heaven"
msgid "MAP_REGION_MOUNTAIN_FRONTIER_411_DESC"
msgstr "A folded mountain gate in the southern range, where paths and formations overlap until direction becomes nearly impossible to judge."
